00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,661
But the measured value at zero degrees is about three hundred and thirty two.

2
00:00:04,661 --> 00:00:10,481
Newton was short by fifty two metres per second, an error of about sixteen percent.

3
00:00:10,481 --> 00:00:13,164
No experiment of that era was that bad.

4
00:00:13,164 --> 00:00:14,895
The assumption had to be wrong.

